name: sim.handleAddOnScripts
description: Lua only. Calls a specific function in add-ons. Should only be called from the main script
pythonSynopsis: int count = sim.handleAddOnScripts(int callType)
inputs:
1. callType: desired system call type (e.g. sysCall_actuation).
outputs:
1. count: number of called add-ons
replacedBy:
- name: handleAddOnScripts, class: app, file: app_handleAddOnScripts.method
